(5155819, 750703, 48389, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful pet portrait! I love the softness around the face and the pose/expression is excellent! Glad to see you had a willing model...I wish I could get my cat to sit still long enough to take a photo like this of him! The only thing I am not sure about in this image is what appears to be the edging of a cushion towards the bottom of the frame, I would have preferred that not to be there but understand it''s not easy getting animals in exactly the right place! An 8 from me :o)</td>', 'What a beautiful pet portrait! I love the softness around the face and the pose/expression is excellent! Glad to see you had a willing model...I wish I could get my cat to sit still long enough to take a photo like this of him! The only thing I am not sure about in this image is what appears to be the edging of a cushion towards the bottom of the frame, I would have preferred that not to be there but understand it''s not easy getting animals in exactly the right place! An 8 from me :o)', '2008-12-29 00:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5155830, 750537, 48389, '<td valign="top">Brighton? If so, I am now trying to think which DPC members live near to me to go and take a shot of this place!! lol</td>', 'Brighton? If so, I am now trying to think which DPC members live near to me to go and take a shot of this place!! lol', '2008-12-29 00:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
