(5155975, 750622, 80167, '<td valign="top">I really like your border in this photo. The centered composition works as well. I just wish there was something more, though.</td>', 'I really like your border in this photo. The centered composition works as well. I just wish there was something more, though.', '2008-12-29 03:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5155978, 749627, 80167, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. The green compliments the black very well and I think the depth of field does an excellent job drawing me into the leaf. The tri-color border is really bothering me, however.</td>', 'I really like this photo. The green compliments the black very well and I think the depth of field does an excellent job drawing me into the leaf. The tri-color border is really bothering me, however.', '2008-12-29 03:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5155982, 750812, 80167, '<td valign="top">I love the movement in this image. The slow shutter speed definitely enhanced this!</td>', 'I love the movement in this image. The slow shutter speed definitely enhanced this!', '2008-12-29 03:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5155988, 750308, 80167, '<td valign="top">Niiiice bokeh!</td>', 'Niiiice bokeh!', '2008-12-29 03:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5155990, 750781, 60173, '<td valign="top">Beautifully sharp. <br/> <br/>Since the challenge is under Advanced rules, I would have cloned out his anklet.</td>', 'Beautifully sharp.  Since the challenge is under Advanced rules, I would have cloned out his anklet.', '2008-12-29 03:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5155993, 750054, 80167, '<td valign="top">I like your composition here a lot. It leads me off the frame following her gaze. The only thing is, I think I might have liked the fan to be on the bottom left of the frame so as to balance the image because so much weight is on the right. Otherwise, I really like the soft focus and dramatic light. 8.</td>', 'I like your composition here a lot. It leads me off the frame following her gaze. The only thing is, I think I might have liked the fan to be on the bottom left of the frame so as to balance the image because so much weight is on the right. Otherwise, I really like the soft focus and dramatic light. 8.', '2008-12-29 03:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5155994, 750792, 60173, '<td valign="top">Yipes, they look like skulls from the thumbnail.</td>', 'Yipes, they look like skulls from the thumbnail.', '2008-12-29 03:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5155996, 750787, 60173, '<td valign="top">Something about her eyes seems very unnatural. Did you dodge the whites?<br/> <br/>The lighting is very nice as is the smoothness of the background.</td>', 'Something about her eyes seems very unnatural. Did you dodge the whites? The lighting is very nice as is the smoothness of the background.', '2008-12-29 03:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5155997, 750726, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is perfectly executed and screams <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34938" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hotpasta</a> to me. I can almost reach through the monitor and grab a taste.</td>', 'This is perfectly executed and screams  hotpasta to me. I can almost reach through the monitor and grab a taste.', '2008-12-29 03:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5156005, 749890, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Any good cook will recognize the presence of these spices; sarson and zaafraan and lal mirchi.</td>', 'Nice.  Any good cook will recognize the presence of these spices; sarson and zaafraan and lal mirchi.', '2008-12-29 04:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5156006, 750315, 30364, '<td valign="top">Best in challenge.  At least it has something authentic to say about being Japanese.</td>', 'Best in challenge.  At least it has something authentic to say about being Japanese.', '2008-12-29 04:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5156017, 750811, 42181, '<td valign="top">Good looking picture and a nice idea but the colour balance is a little off</td>', 'Good looking picture and a nice idea but the colour balance is a little off', '2008-12-29 04:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
