(5156143, 750658, 93756, '<td valign="top">Best of the fortune cookie shots and maybe even best of the food shots because you pulled back and made the cookies look appetizing. Your fortune message is not so in your face so it looks realistic. Your white space and border are pleasing.</td>', 'Best of the fortune cookie shots and maybe even best of the food shots because you pulled back and made the cookies look appetizing. Your fortune message is not so in your face so it looks realistic. Your white space and border are pleasing.', '2008-12-29 09:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
