(5166843, 750820, 100646, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped it so it was a bit more centered and so the stem was closer to the corner. Great colors though.</td>', 'I would have cropped it so it was a bit more centered and so the stem was closer to the corner. Great colors though.', '2009-01-03 04:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
