(5172722, 750813, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>Beautiful image independent of the challenge, and such a great challenge entry as well.  Simple, calligraphic zen feeling.<br/>(a 9 from me)<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-05 13:20:05.</i></td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!Beautiful image independent of the challenge, and such a great challenge entry as well.  Simple, calligraphic zen feeling.(a 9 from me)', '2009-01-05 13:12:56.000000', '2009-01-05 13:20:05.000000', 0),
(5172726, 750815, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>wonderful tone, composition, texture, dof, grain/noise complements the texture.  Nice.<br/>(a 9 from me)<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-05 13:20:30.</i></td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!wonderful tone, composition, texture, dof, grain/noise complements the texture.  Nice.(a 9 from me)', '2009-01-05 13:14:55.000000', '2009-01-05 13:20:30.000000', 0),
(5172736, 750730, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>I really like this--and the "soft center" is nice, I think--just enough there to suggest something, but just what it might be is left to the viewer...  (a 9 from me)<br/> <br/>Remember the old Peanuts cartoon, cloud gazing?  <br/> <br/>Linus says: I see a map of the Holy Land, with the Apostle Paul standing just to one side.<br/> <br/>Charlie Brown says: I was gonna say I saw a ducky and horsey, but I changed my mind....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-05 13:19:27.</i></td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!I really like this--and the "soft center" is nice, I think--just enough there to suggest something, but just what it might be is left to the viewer...  (a 9 from me) Remember the old Peanuts cartoon, cloud gazing?   Linus says: I see a map of the Holy Land, with the Apostle Paul standing just to one side. Charlie Brown says: I was gonna say I saw a ducky and horsey, but I changed my mind....', '2009-01-05 13:18:42.000000', '2009-01-05 13:19:27.000000', 0),
