(5172960, 750718, 61961, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by senor_kasper:</b></div><hr/><i>I am still trying to figure out how to shoot an image that does not deserve scores of 1, 2 or 3, a few pointers on this subject would be appreciated.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>If those voters don''t leave comments explaining why they voted low, all you can do is chalk it up to "you can''t please everyone." <br/> <br/>Congrats on your ribbon, it''s a terrific shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by senor_kasper:I am still trying to figure out how to shoot an image that does not deserve scores of 1, 2 or 3, a few pointers on this subject would be appreciated. If those voters don''t leave comments explaining why they voted low, all you can do is chalk it up to "you can''t please everyone."  Congrats on your ribbon, it''s a terrific shot.', '2009-01-05 15:02:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5172974, 750730, 60173, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by chromeydome:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>I really like this--and the "soft center" is nice, I think--just enough there to suggest something, but just what it might be is left to the viewer...  (a 9 from me)<br/> <br/>Remember the old Peanuts cartoon, cloud gazing?  <br/> <br/>Linus says: I see a map of the Holy Land, with the Apostle Paul standing just to one side.<br/> <br/>Charlie Brown says: I was gonna say I saw a ducky and horsey, but I changed my mind.... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks! I can''t say that I saw that Charlie Brown, but I completely understand.</td>', 'Originally posted by chromeydome: PostLuminous Award Nominee!I really like this--and the "soft center" is nice, I think--just enough there to suggest something, but just what it might be is left to the viewer...  (a 9 from me) Remember the old Peanuts cartoon, cloud gazing?   Linus says: I see a map of the Holy Land, with the Apostle Paul standing just to one side. Charlie Brown says: I was gonna say I saw a ducky and horsey, but I changed my mind....   Thanks! I can''t say that I saw that Charlie Brown, but I completely understand.', '2009-01-05 15:13:52.000000', NULL, 0),
