(5173194, 750718, 51747, '<td valign="top">Great capture. As for the low votes, there will always be people who think that <u>their</u> take on a challenge is the only one. So if you don''t meet their criteria you lose. I am amazed if I <u>don''t</u> get 1''s 2''s and 3''s.  You didn''t deserve anything less than a 5 for this awesome picture.</td>', 'Great capture. As for the low votes, there will always be people who think that their take on a challenge is the only one. So if you don''t meet their criteria you lose. I am amazed if I don''t get 1''s 2''s and 3''s.  You didn''t deserve anything less than a 5 for this awesome picture.', '2009-01-05 17:14:19.000000', NULL, 0),
