(5175614, 750319, 83313, '<td valign="top">I agree that the colors are a little strong. Perhaps reducing the saturation of yellow would give the shrubs a more natural look. Details on the stonework in the foreground seem a  bit washed out as well, which is odd for an HDR. Regarding our discussion of compression, this one is already close to the challenge limit and probably would not compress a lot due to the amount of complicated detail.</td>', 'I agree that the colors are a little strong. Perhaps reducing the saturation of yellow would give the shrubs a more natural look. Details on the stonework in the foreground seem a  bit washed out as well, which is odd for an HDR. Regarding our discussion of compression, this one is already close to the challenge limit and probably would not compress a lot due to the amount of complicated detail.', '2009-01-06 20:01:49.000000', NULL, 0),
