(5645220, 750463, 25355, '<td valign="top">Ah, the thing is, he didn''t make the front page, as his page (i.e. the one on the right) would be one of the last pages. There''s no newspaper logo on the front page (i.e. the one on the left) - it''s the Culture section (!), which means the coversheet has been taken away. (Back page usually has the day''s TV schedule on it.) ;-Þ<br/>   And, oh dear, 16000 Sony employees to be stood down...</td>', 'Ah, the thing is, he didn''t make the front page, as his page (i.e. the one on the right) would be one of the last pages. There''s no newspaper logo on the front page (i.e. the one on the left) - it''s the Culture section (!), which means the coversheet has been taken away. (Back page usually has the day''s TV schedule on it.) ;-Þ   And, oh dear, 16000 Sony employees to be stood down...', '2009-09-13 08:47:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5645323, 750463, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pug-H:</b></div><hr/><i> Ah, the thing is, he didn''t make the front page, as his page (i.e. the one on the right) would be one of the last pages. There''s no newspaper logo on the front page (i.e. the one on the left) - it''s the Culture section (!), which means the coversheet has been taken away. (Back page usually has the day''s TV schedule on it.) ;-Þ<br/>   And, oh dear, 16000 Sony employees to be stood down... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Obviously I don''t read Japanese like you do, and I did not ask my manager''s cultural input for a Godzilla pic!<br/> <br/>I expected someone who reads Japanese would eventually point out some problems!</td>', 'Originally posted by Pug-H: Ah, the thing is, he didn''t make the front page, as his page (i.e. the one on the right) would be one of the last pages. There''s no newspaper logo on the front page (i.e. the one on the left) - it''s the Culture section (!), which means the coversheet has been taken away. (Back page usually has the day''s TV schedule on it.) ;-Þ   And, oh dear, 16000 Sony employees to be stood down...  Obviously I don''t read Japanese like you do, and I did not ask my manager''s cultural input for a Godzilla pic! I expected someone who reads Japanese would eventually point out some problems!', '2009-09-13 12:49:49.000000', NULL, 0),
